note The handler, shared with peek-definition and told apart by the Intent. Finds the word under the pointer, then either asks the language's server for the definition (remembering what the answer is for) or, for a language with a grammar but no server, resolves the word to a symbol at once and lands on it. Asking a server sets the status to LookingUp the word, so a slow server reads as waiting rather than as nothing happening.

