note Where both routes end. With Intent::Jump a symbol lands through jumped_to_symbol, and when that jump started on the Graph tab the References view is brought beside it, because the graph does not leave. A line lands through open_line; an outside definition cannot be jumped to and falls through to the peek, and a peek brings the References view, which draws it, into sight beside the centre tab's view.

